+Every surviving pair has its exact source kernel
+$L=\ker(T_{m,f}:B_3\to Q)$ recorded. It gives an isomorphism
+$B_3/L\simeq B_3/K$; it is an automorphism of the stated quotient
+only when $L=K$.
