+normal subgroup through the given index, without a restriction
+on quotient isomorphism types \citep[\S2.3.2]{Rober2024LINS}.
+The script \texttt{e\_b3\_quotient\_export.g} exports the regular
+coset permutations of both named braid generators. It checks
+normality of the pure image, the braid relation, and quotient
+orders. The authoritative completed file is
+\texttt{e\_b3\_quotients\_complete.json}; optional SmallGrp labels
+are not used to establish completeness. Canonical regular actions
+independently check that no marked kernel was duplicated.
+The cyclic count also follows from $B_3^{\rm ab}=\mathbb Z$.
+Every finite nilpotent quotient is cyclic: each Sylow quotient has
+cyclic abelianization and is cyclic by the Frattini criterion.
+Thus the large collections of unrelated prime-power groups do
+not need enumeration.
