+The two equations evaluated by \texttt{e\_b3\_hexagons.py} are
+\begin{align*}
+ aX^m f^{-1}bY^m f&=f^{-1}ab(ZY)^m,\\
+ f^{-1}bY^m f\,aX^m&=ba(XZ)^m f.
+\end{align*}
+They are the exact braid hexagons of
